---
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Workspace Templates - Claude Spaces" description={"Ready-to-fork Claude Code workspace templates conforming to the Agent Workspace Model."}>

<div class="breadcrumbs">
  <div class="breadcrumbs-inner">
    <a href="/">Index</a>
    <span class="bc-sep">/</span>
    <a href="/ideas/claude-spaces/">Claude Spaces</a>
    <span class="bc-sep">/</span>
    <span class="bc-current">Workspace Templates</span>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page" id="main">
  <h1>Workspace Templates</h1>

  <p>Several repositories serve as templates you can fork and customise for your own needs:</p>

  <ul>
    <li><span class="repo-mention">Claude Diary Planner Template</span> &mdash; daily planning and journaling</li>
    <li><span class="repo-mention">Claude Budget Workspace Template</span> &mdash; personal finance management</li>
    <li><span class="repo-mention">Claude Communications Strategist Template</span> &mdash; media and comms workflows</li>
    <li><span class="repo-mention">Claude Writing Space Template</span> &mdash; long-form writing projects</li>
    <li><span class="repo-mention">Claude Home Assistant Manager Template</span> &mdash; smart home management</li>
    <li><span class="repo-mention">Claude Report Parsing Space Template</span> &mdash; structured document analysis</li>
  </ul>

  <p>Each template comes with a <code>CLAUDE.md</code> file pre-written for that domain, slash commands tailored to common operations, and a directory structure that Claude knows how to work with.</p>

  <div style="margin-top: 2rem;">
    <a href="/?tag=Template" style="font-weight: 500;">Browse all templates in the index &rarr;</a>
  </div>
</div>

</BaseLayout>
